      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱曙开始利落地准备餐点。\n看来这里没有我能帮忙的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f52360333acb6e82c88f1a08213ca32b7a1ec422a3d5038e9b44492080e0fec4",
